          <a href="#agentic-rl">
            <span class="evidence-label">大模型后训练 · Agentic RL</span>
            <strong>93.2<small>%</small></strong>
            <span>动态 Skill 判责准确率 · 召回率 90.8%</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#skill-agent">
            <span class="evidence-label">Agent 自迭代 · 无需参数重训</span>
            <strong>+12.07<small> 个百分点</small></strong>
            <span>准确率 78.23% → 90.30% · 错误减少 55.4%</span>
